        "text": "A preponderance of evidence is a legal term meaning there is greater than a 50% chance that the plaintiff's claims are true.",
        "confidence": 0.99
      },
      {
        "text": "The public hearing phase of impeachment is now concluded.",
        "confidence": 0.98
      },
      {
        "text": "In civil cases, 'preponderance of evidence' is used as the standard of proof.",
        "confidence": 0.98
      },
      {
