        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Each witness corroborated a straightforward assertion that the president mounted a coordinated effort to pressure Ukraine.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The coordination involved pressuring Ukraine to announce an investigation of Trump's domestic political rival.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
